---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<PageLayout
	searchable
	meta={{
		title: "About",
		description:
			"PhD Candidate at UC Merced studying physics and biology of multicellular networks, vascular development, and cell–matrix mechanics",
	}}
>
	<!-- Polaroid-style image (left) + intro text (right) -->
	<section class="mb-12">
		<div class="container mx-auto">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-14 md:gap-20">
				<div class="col-span-2 w-full md:col-span-1">
					<div
						class="relative m-6 w-full max-w-full -rotate-6 border border-gray-100 bg-white p-3 pb-12 shadow-lg transition duration-500 hover:rotate-0 motion-reduce:transition-none md:m-12 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-900"
					>
						<img
							src="/icons/profile.jpg"
							alt="Suraj Sahu"
							class="block aspect-square w-full max-w-full bg-gray-100 object-contain dark:bg-neutral-800"
						/>
						<span
							class="text-accent-2 block pt-3 text-center text-lg font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase sm:text-xl"
							>SURAJ!</span
						>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-span-2 min-w-0 md:col-span-1">
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						PhD Candidate in <a
							class="cactus-link"
							href="http://gopinathanlab.ucmerced.edu"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">Gopinathan Lab</a
						> at <a
							class="cactus-link"
							href="https://www.ucmerced.edu"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">University of California, Merced</a
						>.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						I work at the intersection of physics and biology to understand the mechanisms that make
						life "living." For example, I study how a bunch of cells crawl to form a network, how
						fibroblasts remodel the collagen in your skin during wound healing, the physics behind
						cell–cell adhesion, and how cells push, pull, shove, and squeeze the matrix around them.
						I do all of this by writing code and using some theory.
					</p>
					<h2 class="text-accent-2 mb-4 text-xl font-bold">A Note...</h2>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						Some people might think that saying this could damage my career because it could make me
						seem unsuitable for work. But I have ADHD and OCD! There, I said it.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						I do not mention this because I want you to lower your expectations of me or treat me
						differently. I mention it so that you can understand that my working style might be
						different from yours. Sometimes, the things I can do amaze even me. At other times, even
						moving is hard. I believe that our true potential comes from empathy and from an
						environment that helps us feel our best.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						I will try my best not to let this hinder our working relationship, and I will be clear
						in our communication.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-16 border-t border-gray-200 pt-12 dark:border-white/10">
		<h2 class="text-accent-2 mb-8 text-xl font-bold tracking-wider uppercase">Affiliations</h2>
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
			<div
				class="group hover:border-accent-2/30 dark:hover:border-accent-2/40 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/80 p-6 transition duration-200 hover:shadow-md motion-reduce:transition-none dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5"
			>
				<a
					href="https://www.ucmerced.edu"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener"
					class="flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm dark:bg-black/20"
				>
					<img src="/icons/ucmerced.webp" alt="UC Merced" class="h-12 w-12 object-contain" />
				</a>
				<div class="min-w-0">
					<a
						class="cactus-link text-global-text hover:text-accent-2 font-semibold"
						href="https://www.ucmerced.edu"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener">University of California Merced</a
					>
					<p class="text-global-text mt-1 text-sm opacity-75">
						Graduate Researcher, <a
							class="cactus-link"
							href="http://gopinathanlab.ucmerced.edu"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">Gopinathan Group</a
						>
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mt-0.5 text-sm opacity-75">
						<a
							class="cactus-link"
							href="https://physics.ucmerced.edu"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">Department of Physics</a
						>
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<a
				href="https://cemb.upenn.edu"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener"
				class="group hover:border-accent-2/30 dark:hover:border-accent-2/40 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/80 p-6 transition duration-200 hover:shadow-md motion-reduce:transition-none dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5"
			>
				<div
					class="flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm dark:bg-black/20"
				>
					<img src="/icons/cemb.png" alt="CEMB" class="h-12 w-12 object-contain" />
				</div>
				<div class="min-w-0">
					<p class="cactus-link text-global-text group-hover:text-accent-2 font-semibold">
						Center for Engineering MechanoBiology
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mt-1 text-sm opacity-75">UPenn</p>
				</div>
			</a>
			<a
				href="https://ccbm.ucmerced.edu"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener"
				class="group hover:border-accent-2/30 dark:hover:border-accent-2/40 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/80 p-6 transition duration-200 hover:shadow-md motion-reduce:transition-none dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5"
			>
				<div
					class="flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm dark:bg-black/20"
				>
					<img src="/icons/ccbm.png" alt="CCBM" class="h-12 w-12 object-contain" />
				</div>
				<div class="min-w-0">
					<p class="cactus-link text-global-text group-hover:text-accent-2 font-semibold">
						Center for Cellular and Biomolecular Machines
					</p>
				</div>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</PageLayout>
